# Keep the build context small and avoid copying host-built artefacts into the
# image (they would shadow what the Dockerfile builds).
#
# The sibling apps are NOT excluded: they are declared workspaces in the root
# package.json, so a frozen bun install needs their manifests to resolve.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
**/.expo
**/android
**/ios
apps/mobile/assets
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.DS_Store
